{#
  Shared email <style> block — included verbatim in the email <head>
  (layouts/newsletter-email.njk) and in the web page <head>
  (layouts/newsletter.njk via headExtras).

  Inline styles are the primary styling method. Use this block only
  for what cannot be inlined: media queries, dark mode, hover states.

  Prefix every selector with `.newsletter-issue` (the shell wrapper,
  present in both outputs) so these rules never touch site header /
  footer on the web page, e.g.:

    .newsletter-issue .example { }
    @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
      .newsletter-issue .example { }
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      .newsletter-issue .example { }
    }
#}
